Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.68,0:02:54.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're both involved with Japan Plati?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.74,0:02:56.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:02:58.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.39,0:03:01.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw Misaki talking with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.71,0:03:06.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Weren't you at the company visiting Kotobuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.99,0:03:10.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, the cat's out of the bag now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.81,0:03:12.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're founders.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.94,0:03:15.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those two founded Japan Plati.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.17,0:03:21.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.35,0:03:23.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Neiru! You changed your look?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.28,0:03:26.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll stop if it's weird.{change it back?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.17,0:03:27.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, stay this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.12,0:03:31.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew you had it in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.61,0:03:33.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. You look like a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.18,0:03:36.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or maybe a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:38.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:39.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who're they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.97,0:03:43.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right is Acca. Left is Ura-Acca.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.12,0:03:46.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For real? Acca's totally hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.79,0:03:47.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.56,0:03:49.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like a bad apple.{wat}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.71,0:03:50.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.57,0:03:52.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, they were both human?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.51,0:03:54.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We still are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.09,0:03:57.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We abandoned our bodies and kept just our brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.97,0:04:00.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? Gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.25,0:04:04.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once young scientific geniuses, now just dummies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.24,0:04:09.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure you have a lot of questions, but—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.26,0:04:09.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's from Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.74,0:04:23.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leaving us on read?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:28.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She got asked out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.18,0:04:31.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By a girl again, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.91,0:04:33.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A boy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.86,0:04:41.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.62,0:04:42.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.41,0:04:43.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.84,0:04:45.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Girls' talk! Girls' talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.73,0:04:49.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't they have questions for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.06,0:04:51.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Girls' talk takes priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.73,0:04:56.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh! Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.75,0:05:07.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you changed your hairstyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:07.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.69,0:05:11.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You seem different today yourself, Momoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.37,0:05:11.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:13.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.41,0:05:18.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, who cares? Tell us the rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.66,0:05:20.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:23.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Today, I went on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.35,0:05:27.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where'd you meet him?! You go to a girls' school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.84,0:05:31.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's my follower.{wat} And the first time we met...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.54,0:05:33.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,he told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.04,0:05:34.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Told you what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.85,0:05:36.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-He asked me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.29,0:05:39.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lucky.{That's nice?}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.25,0:05:43.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's over! There won't be a next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.60,0:05:46.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!\NWhy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.86,0:05:48.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was he different on the date?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.05,0:05:49.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.02,0:05:54.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was the first time a guy ever asked me out,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.06,0:06:00.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so I dressed as girly as I could.\NBare legs and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.99,0:06:05.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And when I got to the meeting place,{I got there}\Nhe looked horrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.77,0:06:08.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Horrified? What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.10,0:06:13.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He thought I was a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.40,0:06:18.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, that's the funny thing that happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.34,0:06:21.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't laugh at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.60,0:06:24.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laugh. I'll feel worse otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.88,0:06:29.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,2880)}Oh, here's lunch. I made my specialty, so eat up.{funky fade}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.47,0:06:41.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.95,0:06:44.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Ohto?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.53,0:06:49.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it true you're quitting your job here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.92,0:06:55.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. I think I've figured out a way\Nto make a living as an artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.86,0:06:57.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.37,0:06:58.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Running?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.08,0:07:00.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing.{Nevermind.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.91,0:07:14.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ohto...\NI'm going to hold a small solo exhibition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:17.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come see it if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.96,0:07:26.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What should I do, Leon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.50,0:07:37.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Panic,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.11,0:07:40.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are you a boy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.10,0:07:42.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.75,0:07:47.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It must be nice, not judging by appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.74,0:08:05.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish I could be with someone I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.51,0:08:07.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veni{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.93,0:08:20.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Kurita Kaoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.73,0:08:22.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sound...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.13,0:08:26.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh well, it'd be embarrassing to talk more feminine.{embarassing?}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.89,0:08:31.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you look plenty feminine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.46,0:08:34.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or are you playing up the contrast?{wat}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.52,0:08:37.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:40.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm... Sawaki Momotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.72,0:08:44.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, call me whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.81,0:08:46.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.30,0:08:47.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Momoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.87,0:08:50.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Momoe?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.40,0:08:53.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Momoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.96,0:08:54.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Momoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.14,0:08:59.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tall, cool beauties like you are totally my type.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.37,0:09:02.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh okay, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.76,0:09:04.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't care if I'm a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.24,0:09:06.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just like Haruka.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.26,0:09:07.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haruka?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.64,0:09:11.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's a girl, but she said she loves me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.89,0:09:12.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, a lesbian?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.01,0:09:15.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.17,0:09:16.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.39,0:09:19.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inside...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.59,0:09:23.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.51,0:09:25.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.45,0:09:32.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That crocodile's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.32,0:09:34.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.47,0:09:36.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.36,0:09:37.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, his name's Panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:39.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you full?{ugh}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.94,0:09:45.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The hell is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.82,0:09:53.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Kaoru?{honorifics plz}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.84,0:10:05.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to see you, Kaoru!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.25,0:10:08.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.93,0:10:10.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.68,0:10:13.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're so cute and fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.74,0:10:15.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Almost too fragile to hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.26,0:10:21.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What idiot could believe that you're a boy "on the inside"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.50,0:10:24.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kaoru!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.83,0:10:26.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Momoe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.38,0:10:31.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you after Kaoru, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.56,0:10:33.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.61,0:10:36.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My kendo club advisor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.74,0:10:38.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I went to him for advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.27,0:10:41.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}thought {\i0}he was a good teacher,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.67,0:10:45.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but he pushed me down in the boardinghouse and...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:52.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I... got pregnant.{........}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.05,0:10:56.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I felt bad for the baby, but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.93,0:10:58.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...{......}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.96,0:11:03.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have to say anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.11,0:11:05.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.73,0:11:10.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So am I!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.22,0:11:15.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You won his trust, then exploited him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.25,0:11:18.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate cowards like you more than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.94,0:11:21.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're after Kaoru too, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.34,0:11:25.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll stab you and your disgusting jealousy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.43,0:11:33.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll get you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.60,0:11:37.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who said you could get on top of me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:47.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll kill any man who makes passes at my Kaoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:51.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll cut off the legs they walk {up }on \Nand the mouths they talk with!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.27,0:11:56.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How's Momo? Is she all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.07,0:12:00.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're always worrying about other people,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.67,0:12:04.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but if you don't focus on your \Nown fight, you'll get tripped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.56,0:12:05.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.24,0:12:07.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.44,0:12:12.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or do you do it to avoid thinking about your own problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.64,0:12:18.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all because a painting I did here won a prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.42,0:12:25.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The one of Koito?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.83,0:12:28.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all the way in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.16,0:12:33.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I really want you to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.84,0:12:48.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have some confidence, Kaoru!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.26,0:12:52.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the cutest girl I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.12,0:12:53.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.53,0:12:58.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.83,0:13:00.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a boy...{hmm}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.96,0:13:05.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.75,0:13:07.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.12,0:13:12.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.57,0:13:26.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.44,0:13:29.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.19,0:13:45.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.41,0:13:47.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.03,0:13:52.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.98,0:13:55.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to teach you all over again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.08,0:14:04.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next time I'm reborn, I'll be the one to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.40,0:14:06.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.60,0:14:11.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not all girls want to be protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:14.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.98,0:14:18.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.87,0:14:21.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't get a choice about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:23.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.86,0:14:29.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a lovely girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.11,0:14:34.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you're a brave boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.65,0:14:36.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.80,0:14:38.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{Do}You mind younger guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.77,0:14:41.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It depends how much younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.50,0:14:43.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me make a reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.27,0:14:46.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't get a boyfriend until I see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.86,0:14:47.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.86,0:14:50.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kaoru—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.43,0:15:04.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.99,0:15:16.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.03,0:15:18.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.12,0:15:19.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.11,0:15:20.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.18,0:15:21.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.33,0:15:22.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.33,0:15:23.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.38,0:15:32.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haruka?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.21,0:15:37.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Momoe?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.06,0:15:47.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.94,0:15:53.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But her statue's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.65,0:15:55.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.86,0:15:57.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's really over!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.71,0:16:10.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Momoe won't be coming anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.21,0:16:13.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NShe cleared the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.92,0:16:14.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.32,0:16:18.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Work hard so that you can follow in her footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.51,0:16:22.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Meaning Momoe got out first?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.12,0:16:23.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She could have told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.88,0:16:24.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.86,0:16:32.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry! I remembered something I have to do after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.27,0:16:34.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.64,0:16:36.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "after all"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.95,0:16:37.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.41,0:16:42.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wanna go for ramen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.30,0:16:43.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.68,0:16:46.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.86,0:16:58.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, Ai?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.22,0:16:59.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's getting late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.47,0:17:00.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just... stuff with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.97,0:17:02.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.64,0:17:05.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.41,0:17:09.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.73,0:17:13.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make sure you message me every 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.16,0:17:15.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yup. I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.63,0:17:40.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.38,0:17:43.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it's different?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.51,0:17:45.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.89,0:17:47.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you, grown up.{scratch the you?}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.14,0:17:53.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's me... grown up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.02,0:17:57.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it looks like someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.53,0:18:03.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.07,0:18:04.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.{Exactly/That's right/Right}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.46,0:18:09.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someday, you'll be a wonderful,\Nadult woman like your mother.{scratch the "adult"}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.00,0:18:14.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kind, strong, and beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.53,0:18:19.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You love my mom, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.22,0:18:22.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. With all my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.34,0:18:25.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're her daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.22,0:18:31.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so you should have faith in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.06,0:18:34.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sawaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.40,0:18:35.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.42,0:18:40.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something I want to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.04,0:18:46.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did Koito die?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.70,0:18:53.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our plans may end up going off-course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.82,0:18:55.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.84,0:19:01.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To confront Thanatos, we need\Nwarriors of Eros, his polar opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.55,0:19:05.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will Momoe go back there for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.64,0:19:07.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.85,0:19:10.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She knows it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.04,0:19:13.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The overwhelming fear of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.57,0:19:28.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bad girl.\NI'll tell teacher on you.{wat}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.99,0:19:31.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Congratulations. You completed your mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.37,0:19:33.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That girl came back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.46,0:19:34.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veni{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.37,0:19:36.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like to let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.18,0:19:41.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Out of respect for the way you've\Nrisked your life for friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.51,0:19:45.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you see, Frill will get mad at me if she finds out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.45,0:19:47.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Frill?{Brain?}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.23,0:19:51.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a pain, so I'll cut to the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.02,0:19:53.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want to die here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.07,0:20:03.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.99,0:20:14.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Panic...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.87,0:20:19.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, I guess I'll settle for this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.63,0:20:28.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They say crocodile tastes like chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.14,0:20:37.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have some, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.28,0:20:50.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.04,0:21:02.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fad(3000,0)}I can't sleep. I can't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.68,0:21:06.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't\Nsleep. I can't sleep. I can't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.88,0:21:11.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't sleep. I can't sleep. {Don't fall asleep.}{Can't fall asleep.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.46,0:22:48.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To be continued.
